[{"answer":"I haven't seen you for a bit, Marie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No. I've been busy with my project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You're making a vegan alternative to eggs, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Something that doesn't use animal products?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I'm using chickpeas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I had two main aims when I first started looking for an alternative to eggs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually I've found chickpeas have got more advantages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But how about your project on reusing waste food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You were looking at bread, weren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It's been hard work, but I've enjoyed it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The basic process was quite straightforward:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"breaking the stale bread down to a paste then reforming it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But you were using 3-D printing, weren't you, to make the paste into biscuits?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'd used that before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but in this project, I had time to play around with different patterns for the biscuits","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and finding how I could add fruit and vegetables to make them a more appetising colour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I was really pleased with what I managed to produce.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It must've been a great feeling to make something appetising out of bits of old bread that would've been thrown away otherwise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And I'm hoping that some of the restaurants in town will be interested in the biscuits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm going to send them some samples.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I came across something on the internet yesterday that might interest you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a company that's developed touch-sensitive sensors for food labels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a special sort of label on the food package.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"When the label's smooth, the food is fresh","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and then when you can feel bumps on the label,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"that means the food's gone bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It started off as a project to help visually impaired people know whether food was fit to eat or not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So just solid food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No, things like milk and juice as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But actually, I thought it might be really good for drug storage in hospitals and pharmacies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And coming back to food,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"maybe it'd be possible to use it for other things besides freshness.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Like how many kilograms a joint of meat is, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there's all sorts of possibilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I was reading an article about food trends","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"predicting how eating habits might change in the next few years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/39-2024-07-05-15-17-55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... things like more focus on local products?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That seems so obvious, but the shops are still full of imported foods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they need to be more proactive to address that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And somehow motivate consumers to change, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing everyone's aware of is the need for a reduction in unnecessary packaging","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but just about everything you buy in supermarkets is still covered in plastic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The government needs to do something about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely. It's got to change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think there'll be more interest in gluten- and lactose-free food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"For people with allergies or food intolerances?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Lots of people I know have been buying that type of food for years now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, even if they haven't been diagnosed with an allergy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing I've noticed is the number of branded products related to celebrity chefs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"People watch them cooking on TV","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and then buy things like spice mixes or frozen foods with the chef's name on...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I bought something like that once, but I won't again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah I bought a ready-made spice mix for chicken","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"which was supposed to be used by a chef I'd seen on television,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and it didn't actually taste of anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Did the article mention 'ghost kitchens' used to produce takeaway food?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No. What are they?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they might have the name of a restaurant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually they're a cooking facility just for delivery meals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The public don't ever go there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But people aren't aware of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's all kept very quiet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So people don't realise the food's not actually from the restaurant?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you know more and more people are using all sorts of different mushrooms now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"to treat different health concerns?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Things like heart problems?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. They might be taking a big risk there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's hard to know which varieties are safe to eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-1-part-3-2024-06-29-10-08-13/75_v3.mp3"}]
